    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The Geth Spitfire is a heavy infantry weapon fielded by Geth Primes during the Reaper War, offering the sustained fire rate of a machine gun with the stopping power of a heavy weapon. Its enormous heat sink capacity sustains two hundred and fifty rounds of high-velocity kinetic fire without interruption. The weapon was designed for Geth platforms that do not fatigue; organic users who attempt to match that fire discipline typically find their arms giving out before the heat sink does.</p>"
